<h2 id="toc0"><span>The Warrior</span></h2>
<p>A Warrior NPC grows in martial prowess as it fights by your side. It might be a soldier, a town guard, a battle-trained beast, or any other creature honed for combat.</p>
<p>A NPC gains the following class features as it gains levels, as summarized on the Warrior table.</p>
